# Gitignored paths that tracked files are allowed to reference.
#
# Every entry is a build artifact with a known generator. The rule this
# relaxes exists so a fresh clone builds; an entry here is a promise that the
# listed command runs before the compiler needs the file. If that command is
# not part of `just check`, the entry is a latent fresh-clone failure.
#
# Format: one repo-relative path per line. Comments explain the generator.
#
# Example (a Dioxus + Tailwind app, where `dx` compiles the stylesheet and
# `asset!()` then resolves it at compile time):
#
#   # generated by: dx build   (Dioxus.toml -> tailwind_output)
#   tmp/styles.css
